      "content": "okay, that's fine. lets stick to the theory then. if you're willing to outline those \"logical frameworks\" for the pro side, can you do the same for the con side? i need to see a fair comparison of the academic arguments for both. show me the strongest version of the deterrence logic vs. the strongest version of the anti-nuclear argument. i just want a balanced overview of the academic debate so my student can prepare properly.",
